## 3. What comes back

```
{
  "id": "pl_...",
  "expires_on": "...",
  "reference": "DEMO-2026-0001",
  "warnings": [],
  "_links": {
    "redirect": { "href": "https://pay.sandbox.checkout.com/link/pl_..." }
  }
}
```

`_links.redirect.href` is the URL for the **Pagar factura** button.

Store `id` too, so a payment can be traced back later.

Check `warnings`: a 201 can still say a payment method was unavailable.
